  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/617/header-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"175\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">一款以冒險為主的整合包，收錄槍械、任務、科技、BOSS 與姿勢動作。</span></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/620/description-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"200\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 本整合包收錄了槍械與各種生活品質提升模組，將徹底改變您的原版體驗。與朋友同樂或獨自冒險皆可。開始進行任務並收集戰利品，擊敗首領以獲取獎勵。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 按下 I 鍵開啟任務選單，您可以在這裡閱讀更多資訊、領取獎勵、購買道具，或在武器賭場中大贏特贏。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 使用槍匠工作台合成超過 100 種槍枝與彈藥</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 按下 K 鍵開啟表情與姿勢選單，在朋友面前擺出各種姿勢與表情。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 按下 L 鍵開啟進度選單，查看基於進度的任務與賭場內容</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 針對低階電腦優化（若 FPS 過低請關閉光影）。 </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 專為多人遊戲設計。只需使用內建的 Essential 模組連線至好友，或下載官方伺服器套件即可架設支援大量玩家的大型伺服器。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 本整合包以 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TacZ 模組</a> 為基礎，並將鑽石作為主要貨幣</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/621/screenshots-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"200\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/606/2025-04-23_09-44-44-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/613/2025-04-23_10-44-20-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1183/6/2025-05-09_23-26-07-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/610/2025-04-23_10-47-40-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/611/2025-04-23_03-19-13-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1170/391/2025-04-27_02-46-51-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/612/2025-04-23_10-53-38-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1180/218/2025-05-07_09-27-45-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1184/294/2025-05-11_00-07-09-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p>\n<p>來看看 TacZ 模組的一些精彩內容：-</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:1024px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bG9-8agYVyI\" width=\"1024\" height=\"601\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>來看看本整合包收錄的 GamerPotion 系列模組：</p>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkquesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/20/638809215458543440.png\" alt=\"黑暗任務\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkbindings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/22/638809215919453329.png\" alt=\"黑暗快捷鍵\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkrtp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/23/638809216123403947.png\" alt=\"黑暗隨機傳送\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkloot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/24/638809216321911073.png\" alt=\"黑暗戰利品\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkmining\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/25/638809216501497991.png\" alt=\"黑暗採礦\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darktides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/27/638809216660603276.png\" alt=\"黑暗潮汐\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkflight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/28/638809216809180808.png\" alt=\"黑暗飛行\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkspins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/30/638809216964676688.png\" alt=\"黑暗轉盤\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkcap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/32/638809217184191101.png\" alt=\"黑暗帽子\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkwooly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/33/638809217370362274.png\" alt=\"黑暗羊毛\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkrpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/35/638809217704081559.png\" alt=\"黑暗選單\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkinventory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/34/638809217526564954.png\" alt=\"黑暗背包\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkstarter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/36/638809217955951522.png\" alt=\"黑暗新手包\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.cursef